{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":17,"ref":"psalms 86:17","book":"psalms","lang":"yo","chapter":86,"translation":"Ṣe àmì fún mi ní oore-ọfẹ́, kí àwọn olúkùúnì mi kí ó lè rí i, kí wọ́n sì tì yà, nítorí pé ìwọ, Yahweh, ni ó ṣèrànlọ́ fún mi, ìwọ sì ṣèìtùní fún mi.","tokens":[{"surface":"עשה","gloss":"Ṣe"},{"surface":"עמי","gloss":"fún mi"},{"surface":"אות","gloss":"àmì"},{"surface":"לטובה","gloss":"ní oore-ọfẹ́"},{"surface":"ויראו","gloss":"kí wọ́n ó sì rí i"},{"surface":"שנאי","gloss":"àwọn olúkùúnì mi"},{"surface":"ויבשו","gloss":"kí wọ́n sì tì yà"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"nítorí pé"},{"surface":"אתה","gloss":"ìwọ"},{"surface":"יהוה","gloss":"Yahweh"},{"surface":"עזרתני","gloss":"ó ṣèrànlọ́ fún mi"},{"surface":"ונחמתני","gloss":"ó sì ṣèìtùní fún mi"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-23T03:45:01.211037069Z","model":"glm-5.3"}